    "projectDescriptionEn": "<p>A network of 20 dental clinics located in Riyadh provides comprehensive dental treatment and cosmetic services. These facilities offer a diverse range of dental services, including orthodontics, prosthodontics, periodontics, oral surgery, dental fillings, endodontics, general dentistry, scaling, and pedodontics.</p>\r\n",
